TITLE:: WriteCommand
SUMMARY:: Command that writes the piano-roll pattern to the sequencer document.
CATEGORIES:: Commands
RELATED:: Classes/Command, Classes/CommandPrompt, Classes/PianoRoll, Classes/SequencerDocument

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::WriteCommand:: is a LINK::Classes/Command:: with no extra parameters. When executed, it invokes an optional action callback, which LINK::Classes/PianoRoll:: uses to write pattern source through LINK::Classes/SequencerDocument#-insertPattern::.

Because the command has no parameters, LINK::Classes/CommandPrompt:: treats it as satisfied as soon as the command chip is committed. Press Return to execute.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a new TELETYPE::WriteCommand::.

ARGUMENT:: action
An optional callback LINK::Classes/Function:: evaluated on execution. Receives the arguments LINK::Classes/Dictionary:: (empty for this command).

RETURNS::
A new TELETYPE::WriteCommand:: instance.
